## Epoch AI benchmark data

- **Location:** `crates/slices/jinn-model-market/src/seed/` —
  `eci_scores.csv`, `benchmark_metadata.csv`, `model_metadata.csv`
  (compiled into the binary with `include_bytes!`). Runtime refreshes
  extract the same three files to `~/.cache/jinn/epoch/`; `<c-r>` in the
  model-market popup re-downloads them.
- **License:** Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0)
- **Source:** https://epoch.ai/benchmarks/use-this-data

The Epoch Capabilities Index (ECI) and its confidence intervals, shown
in jinn's model-market popup, are Epoch AI's data, used unmodified.

Epoch AI's licensing terms: "Epoch AI's data is free to use, distribute,
and reproduce provided the source and authors are credited under the
Creative Commons Attribution license."

Required attribution, verbatim:

    Epoch AI, 'Capabilities & benchmarking'. Published online at epoch.ai.
    Retrieved from 'https://epoch.ai/benchmarks/use-this-data' [online resource].
    Accessed 15 Oct 2026.

Benchmark questions and answers are the property of their respective
creators; the seed files ship the ECI scores and normalization metadata
only, not benchmark items.
